ummac\}$, processor $i$ uses its local dataset $\samples_{1, i}$ to compute the local empirical minimizer  egin{align} \optvar_{1, i} & \in \argmin_{\optvar \in \optvarspace} \MYMIN{\underbrace{ rac{1}{|S_{1,i}|} \sum_{x \in S_{1,i}} f(\optvar; x)}_{F_{1,i}(\optvar)}}. \end{align} \item[(2)] These $
ummac$ local estimates are then averaged together---that is, we compute  egin{equation} \optavg_1 =  rac{1}{
ummac} \sum_{i = 1}^
